            "comprehends": [
             "copies/ym420hv4366#inscription"
            ],
            "note": "No date was read in it, so its figures were not graded. A name in ink, no date with it. Crop 5 shows the roll's printed leader label, 'No. 231 / Lied ohne Worte / Op. 62. No. 28 / F. Mendelssohn. / Gespielt von Hermann Möhle.', with 'Patentiert in allen Kulturstaaten' and the M. Welte & Söhne copyright slip; crop 6 is a QPcard 101 colour target. Crops 2 to 4 blank."
           }
          ]
         }
        }
       }
